WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.240 --> 00:00:04.090
LEDs tucked into tires for instance.

00:00:04.090 --> 00:00:07.000
Or a bike helmet with indicators.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:13.019
Or even a digital anti-theft device.

00:00:13.019 --> 00:00:17.910
Smart bikes have plenty of innovative features
that users can control on the display or via

00:00:17.910 --> 00:00:19.550
a phone app.

00:00:19.550 --> 00:00:24.039
Online marketing consultant Frank Algermissen
doesn't need a key to unlock his bike - just

00:00:24.039 --> 00:00:25.390
his phone.

00:00:25.390 --> 00:00:28.340
He's had a smart bike for about a year now.

00:00:28.340 --> 00:00:34.700
"There's a fun factor when you go to buy bread
or ice-cream for example.

00:00:34.700 --> 00:00:40.970
Others have to find their keys etc, whereas
all I have to do is get my phone out, tap

00:00:40.970 --> 00:00:46.970
it, unlock the bike or turn on the lights...
that sort of stuff."

00:00:46.970 --> 00:00:54.640
Is this bike-smartphone combo a winner or
will cyclists remain loyal to their

00:00:54.640 --> 00:01:01.140
The bike journalist David Koßmann thinks
cyclists will go for the gimmicks.

00:01:01.140 --> 00:01:07.079
"There's a gold rush fever at the moment,
when you look at the crowdfunding campaigns,

00:01:07.079 --> 00:01:09.649
the start-ups, the gadgets that are being
developed.

00:01:09.649 --> 00:01:15.400
There are so many options and we'll see which
ones actually establish themselves.

00:01:15.400 --> 00:01:20.070
I think it has a lot to do with how society
is developing and the way people are using

00:01:20.070 --> 00:01:27.890
data acquisition devices."

00:01:27.890 --> 00:01:32.659
There's certainly a high demand for gadgets
and apps - like the "Bike Citizens," especially

00:01:32.659 --> 00:01:34.969
for urban cyclists.

00:01:34.969 --> 00:01:38.119
It favors cycle paths and side streets.

00:01:38.119 --> 00:01:43.780
The app also wants to influence city planning
by evaluating data to improve the infrastructure.

00:01:43.780 --> 00:01:48.890
This helps to create what are known as "heat
maps" which show frequently traveled routes.

00:01:48.890 --> 00:01:51.780
"There's a data protection issue.

00:01:51.780 --> 00:01:55.100
Companies collecting data have to ensure it's
secure.

00:01:55.100 --> 00:01:58.929
And there are databases being hacked into
and information being put online.

00:01:58.929 --> 00:02:03.340
The information that is gathered, the mobility
behavior, can also be used by bike thieves

00:02:03.340 --> 00:02:07.679
of course."

00:02:07.679 --> 00:02:11.380
Which would be a coup because smart bikes
go for around 10,000 euros.

00:02:11.380 --> 00:02:17.620
But a stolen smart bike can be easily located
thanks to in-built tracking technology.

00:02:17.620 --> 00:02:24.410
That's what the bike maker Vanmoof uses:
"This is the page we can use to find the bikes

00:02:24.410 --> 00:02:30.340
again; it's connected to the bike via GPS
tracking and it's visible here on the screen

00:02:30.340 --> 00:02:31.340
directly.

00:02:31.340 --> 00:02:36.030
We can just see where it was at any time."

00:02:36.030 --> 00:02:44.720
But in practice, it's perhaps a little more
adventurous than all this.

00:02:44.720 --> 00:02:50.750
A team from Vanmoof tracked one stolen bike
from Paris, France to Casablanca in Morocco.

00:02:50.750 --> 00:02:54.840
They zigzagged around the city in a taxi,
equipped with their tracker.

00:02:54.840 --> 00:02:57.990
And they did find the stolen bike in a garage.

00:02:57.990 --> 00:03:01.790
But the Moroccan authorities stopped them
from bringing it back.

00:03:01.790 --> 00:03:05.050
Fans think that data collection has its advantages.

00:03:05.050 --> 00:03:09.720
Some smart bike users don't mind being under
surveillance.

00:03:09.720 --> 00:03:14.430
"I'm not worried about it at all.

00:03:14.430 --> 00:03:18.120
Anyone who wants my data can have it.

00:03:18.120 --> 00:03:25.050
Anyone who wants to spy on me or get into
my bike app will always find a way.

00:03:25.050 --> 00:03:30.520
I prefer to concentrate on the advantages
and all the options for playing around."

00:03:30.520 --> 00:03:36.680
There is plenty in store for the fans of smart
bikes and gadgets.

00:03:36.680 --> 00:03:39.909
However, nobody expects the wheel to be reinvented!

